# Upstream icon sets kept as reference material for authoring the UI. The page
# inlines the handful of glyphs it actually uses, so nothing here is a runtime
# dependency — but 1,882 SVGs against one 173 KB HTML file made Linguist report
# the project as 98.8% SVG. Marking them vendored keeps them in the repo while
# leaving the language stats describing the app itself.
assets/logos/**    linguist-vendored
assets/boxicons/** linguist-vendored

# Single-file app: let GitHub count it as the source it is.
index.html linguist-detectable
